    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Milan was laid out in 1854 when the railroad reached the town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milan%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 1954 Milan High School team won Indiana’s state basketball title, a feat that inspired the film Hoosiers.",
